tica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">北京大学开源One-Eval评测框架，实现DeepSeek-V4全量自动化评测</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI联手联发科、高通与立讯精密研发去应用化AI手机</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Adobe王炸更新：Firefly智能体公测，Photoshop竟能“自如编排”？</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软与OpenAI修订合作协议：独占授权转为非独占并停止营收分成</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e2ab3ef4ec8c64bb0f52cf5c4949163e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软与OpenAI正式修订合作协议，将此前对OpenAI模型及产品的独占授权调整为非独占模式，有效期至2032年。此次调整后，OpenAI获得自主权，可向客户提供通过任何云服务商部署的产品。尽管授权模式变更，微软仍保持OpenAI首要云服务合作伙伴地位，OpenAI新产品将优先在Azure上线，双方在数据中心与芯片研发领域的合作保持不变。在财务条款方面，微软将停止向OpenAI支付营收分成，而OpenAI向微软支付的分成将持续至2030年并设有总额上限。此次协议修订旨在理顺双方运营细则，在保留微软作为主要股东权益的同时，赋予OpenAI更大的市场拓展空间，标志着双方合作关系从紧密绑定向更具灵活性的商业模式转型。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">小米新款全尺寸人形机器人亮相投资者日，已在汽车工厂实现超90%安装成功率</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e048fcb66d7a040b511bc71fca6d951b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">小米在投资者大会上展示了研发四年的新款全尺寸人形机器人，标志着其具身智能技术从实验室迈向工厂实操。该机器人具备极强的感知与执行能力，能精准识别并抓取纸袋提手等细微目标。目前，该机器人已在小米汽车工厂完成连续3小时自主作业，在复杂零部件安装任务中，安装成功率突破90%，数据表现已持平甚至超越部分工业机械臂。小米通过本体设计与智能算法的全栈自研，验证了通用人形机器人在柔性制造场景的生产力价值。根据战略规划，小米人形机器人计划在未来5年内实现大批量工厂进驻，并在5至10年内渗透至办公及家庭场景。作为“人车家全生态”的关键载体，该技术的迭代不仅支撑了小米的智能制造体系，也为未来家庭服务机器人的规模化普及奠定了工程化基础。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">北京大学开源One-Eval评测框架，实现DeepSeek-V4全量自动化评测</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a9d6ed61bca0e37f74e8e69b006cbedb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">北京大学DCAI团队正式开源评测框架One-Eval，旨在解决大模型评测流程繁琐、黑盒化及数据污染等行业痛点。在DeepSeek-V4发布仅10小时内，该团队便利用One-Eval完成了全量自动化评测报告。One-Eval通过智能体化驱动，将复杂的脚本操作转化为自然语言交互，系统可自动识别测试意图并匹配金融、法律、医疗等专业基准工具。该框架引入“全局状态”总线架构确保全链路可追溯，并保留“人工在环”机制以平衡自动化与专业干预。One-Eval的开源为大模型评测赛道引入了技术变量，通过提升评测效率与透明度，挑战了传统评测机构“诊断+卖药”的商业闭环模式，为开发者提供了一种更高效、灵活的评测解决方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI联手联发科、高通与立讯精密研发去应用化AI手机</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/40228632a3893ece841b3cb4f05c2fbb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正与联发科、高通及立讯精密合作研发一款以AI Agent为核心的智能手机，旨在通过底层硬件重构移动终端交互逻辑。该项目核心在于“去应用化”，即利用AI Agent取代传统App生态，通过理解用户上下文语境直接完成任务。技术架构上，设备将结合端侧小型模型与云端大模型，根据任务复杂度动态调配计算资源。目前，该手机项目预计于2026年底或2027年第一季度敲定规格，最早有望在2028年实现量产。此外，OpenAI在硬件领域的布局已先行启动，其首款硬件产品（推测为智能耳塞）预计将于2026年下半年发布。此次跨界合作标志着OpenAI正从软件生态向物理终端深度延伸，试图通过软硬一体化策略，彻底改变用户与移动设备的交互方式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Adobe王炸更新：Firefly智能体公测，Photoshop竟能“自如编排”？</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ea0e3079ea88ac5b4bb5040949d6bae6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Adobe王炸更新：Firefly智能体公测，Photoshop竟能“自如编排”。AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Apr 28, 20266Adobe公司于 4 月 28 日正式宣布，其备受期待的Firefly AI Assistant（Firefly AI助手）正式进入公测阶段，并开始向全球符合条件的订阅用户开放。首批体验名单涵盖了Creative Cloud Pro用户，以及Firefly Pro和Premium等付费方案的持有者。此次更新的核心亮点在于Firefly从单一的生成工具进化为“跨应用Agent（智能体）”。这意味着创作者不再需要精通Photoshop、Premiere、Illustrator或Lightroom等软件中复杂的菜单路径和操作细节。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
